# --- Internal tooling and docs: blocked at the edge, not deleted ---------------
# Cloudflare Pages publishes whatever sits in the repo root, so these returned
# HTTP 200 on the live domains. They cannot simply be removed: generate_sitemap.py
# is run by the Cloudflare build, package.json by npm, and .github/workflows must
# live at that exact path for GitHub to run the job.
#
# Status is 301, not 404, and that is deliberate: Pages _redirects does NOT support
# a 404 status. Rules written that way are silently dropped and the file keeps
# serving 200 - measured on staging 2026-10-01. A 301 is honoured and does shadow
# an existing static file.
#
# Verified before blocking: none of these are fetched at runtime by any page.
# NOT blocked, both confirmed fetched at runtime:
#   sitemap-style.xsl    - referenced by sitemap.xml
#   data/plan-year.json  - fetched by the plan-finder widget
/.github/*               /           301
/site-check.py           /           301
/smoke-check.py          /           301
/generate_sitemap.py     /           301
/generate_blog_index.py  /           301
/package.json            /           301
/package-lock.json       /           301
/medicare-figures.json   /           301
/README.md               /           301
/README-AB-TESTING.md    /           301
